WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.767 --> 00:00:02.133
-Welcome back,

00:00:02.133 --> 00:00:03.133
and thank you for being here,
thank you for watching.

00:00:03.133 --> 00:00:04.601
Today is Friday,

00:00:04.601 --> 00:00:05.667
and that's usually when I catch
up with some personal stuff.

00:00:05.667 --> 00:00:07.234
You know, I check my inbox,

00:00:07.234 --> 00:00:08.567
I return some e-mails,

00:00:08.567 --> 00:00:10.367
and, of course,
I send out thank-you notes.

00:00:10.367 --> 00:00:12.467
And I was just running
a bit behind --

00:00:12.467 --> 00:00:14.300
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:14.300 --> 00:00:15.467
I was running
a bit behind today,

00:00:15.467 --> 00:00:16.901
and so I thought
if you guys wouldn't mind,

00:00:16.901 --> 00:00:18.734
I'd like to write out my weekly
thank-you notes right now.

00:00:18.734 --> 00:00:19.801
Is that cool with you guys?

00:00:19.801 --> 00:00:20.868
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:20.868 --> 00:00:22.934
Thank you.
I appreciate that.

00:00:22.934 --> 00:00:25.234
James, can I get some thank-you
note writing note music, please?

00:00:25.234 --> 00:00:26.534
♪♪

00:00:26.534 --> 00:00:27.534
Wow.

00:00:27.534 --> 00:00:29.200
♪♪

00:00:29.200 --> 00:00:30.267
-Oh, he blinked.

00:00:30.267 --> 00:00:31.601
-He's got -- Yeah.

00:00:31.601 --> 00:00:33.234
-That's to show he's not wax.

00:00:33.234 --> 00:00:34.701
[ Laughter ]

00:00:34.701 --> 00:00:35.734
-He's not waxed?

00:00:35.734 --> 00:00:37.200
-He's not made of wax.
-Oh.

00:00:38.434 --> 00:00:39.467
-You didn't know it --
-I thought you were

00:00:39.467 --> 00:00:41.334
talking about --
I thought you were saying

00:00:41.334 --> 00:00:42.467
that he wasn't manscaping.

00:00:42.467 --> 00:00:44.501
-Oh, no, he's manscaped.

00:00:44.501 --> 00:00:45.701
He's totally manscaped.

00:00:45.701 --> 00:00:47.501
[ Laughter ]

00:00:47.501 --> 00:00:49.100
He's got the whole thing,
a razor kit --

00:00:49.100 --> 00:00:50.567
you don't want to know about it.

00:00:50.567 --> 00:00:54.334
-Yeah, I see he posted
"vaxed and waxed."

00:00:54.334 --> 00:00:55.868
-"VaxedAndWaxed"
is his Instagram account.

00:00:55.868 --> 00:00:57.133
-Yeah.
I didn't open the photo.

00:00:57.133 --> 00:00:59.167
-Yeah, don't.

00:00:59.167 --> 00:01:00.834
Don't look it up
on the Internet, either.

00:01:00.834 --> 00:01:02.634
[ Laughter ]

00:01:05.501 --> 00:01:06.801
♪♪

00:01:06.801 --> 00:01:08.634
-Thank you, the White House,

00:01:08.634 --> 00:01:11.267
for sending everyone
high-quality masks

00:01:11.267 --> 00:01:13.701
that most people will still wear
on their chin.

00:01:13.701 --> 00:01:16.234
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:20.334 --> 00:01:21.868
♪♪

00:01:21.868 --> 00:01:24.167
Thank you, Coachella poster,

00:01:24.167 --> 00:01:26.501
for looking like
a musical eyesight exam.

00:01:26.501 --> 00:01:28.601
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:28.601 --> 00:01:30.968
-Harry Po-- Harry styles.

00:01:30.968 --> 00:01:32.200
Harry Styles?

00:01:35.534 --> 00:01:37.567
[ Laughter ]
-Can't tell.

00:01:37.567 --> 00:01:40.100
-No, I can't tell
who's on earlier in the day.

00:01:43.167 --> 00:01:44.901
Death by Voguing?
Is that a band?

00:01:44.901 --> 00:01:46.400
-Yeah. [ Chuckles ]

00:01:47.834 --> 00:01:48.834
Everybody's equal.

00:01:48.834 --> 00:01:49.834
-What?

00:01:49.834 --> 00:01:50.934
[ Laughter ]

00:01:50.934 --> 00:01:52.667
-At Coachella,
everybody's equal.

00:01:52.667 --> 00:01:53.734
-Oh, wow.

00:01:53.734 --> 00:01:55.501
-Yeah, all the same
9-point font.

00:01:57.067 --> 00:01:58.167
-They're all equal?
-Yeah.

00:01:58.167 --> 00:01:59.701
-So they get paid --
Death by Vogue

00:01:59.701 --> 00:02:01.167
gets the same paycheck
as Harry Styles?

00:02:01.167 --> 00:02:02.667
-Oh, no, no, no.

00:02:02.667 --> 00:02:04.100
-Oh, hell no.
-Yeah.

00:02:04.100 --> 00:02:06.234
[ Laughter ]

00:02:07.167 --> 00:02:08.767
-Alright.
-All right, back to work.

00:02:08.767 --> 00:02:10.634
-Back to work.
No more goofing around.

00:02:10.634 --> 00:02:13.067
-Yeah, quit goofing around.
Just get back to work.

00:02:13.067 --> 00:02:14.868
-What's that?
-I said quit goofing around...

00:02:14.868 --> 00:02:15.934
-Yeah.
-...and get back to work.

00:02:15.934 --> 00:02:17.734
-Back to work.
-Yeah.

00:02:17.734 --> 00:02:19.667
-Got to be done.
-Gotta work!

00:02:19.667 --> 00:02:21.200
-What? Work.

00:02:21.200 --> 00:02:23.300
♪ And work, and work ♪
-And work -- yeah.

00:02:23.300 --> 00:02:25.334
-♪ Ber-be-der-be-der, work ♪

00:02:25.334 --> 00:02:26.501
♪♪

00:02:26.501 --> 00:02:29.033
♪ Da-da-dun, da-da-dun,
and work ♪

00:02:29.033 --> 00:02:30.200
♪ And work ♪

00:02:30.200 --> 00:02:32.968
♪ Come on, now,
let's dance on it, work ♪

00:02:32.968 --> 00:02:34.133
♪ Work ♪

00:02:34.133 --> 00:02:36.067
♪ Come on, now, workin' ♪

00:02:36.067 --> 00:02:37.434
♪ Car ♪

00:02:37.434 --> 00:02:39.801
♪ Get you car washed today ♪

00:02:41.200 --> 00:02:43.634
♪ Fill up,
and you don't have to pay ♪

00:02:45.701 --> 00:02:47.501
♪ Come on, na, na, na ♪

00:02:47.501 --> 00:02:48.667
[ Vocalizing ]

00:02:48.667 --> 00:02:50.467
-♪ Working at the car wash ♪

00:02:52.267 --> 00:02:54.534
♪ Working at the car wash,
yeah ♪

00:02:56.133 --> 00:02:57.334
-That's a jam, man.

00:02:57.334 --> 00:02:58.968
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:02:58.968 --> 00:03:00.234
That's my jam.

00:03:00.234 --> 00:03:01.300
-Yeah.

00:03:01.300 --> 00:03:02.501
-A banger.

00:03:04.200 --> 00:03:05.567
♪♪

00:03:05.567 --> 00:03:10.868
Thank you, "abcdefu,"
for being a great breakup song,

00:03:10.868 --> 00:03:12.400
and also the reason
the preschool called

00:03:12.400 --> 00:03:14.133
to schedule a parent/teacher
conference.

00:03:14.133 --> 00:03:15.934
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:03:19.400 --> 00:03:20.934
-Blah-blah-blah-blah-blah.

00:03:20.934 --> 00:03:22.634
[ Light laughter ]

00:03:22.634 --> 00:03:24.067
♪♪

00:03:24.067 --> 00:03:26.267
-Thank you, dentist appointment,

00:03:26.267 --> 00:03:27.767
for beginning
with a quick Q and A

00:03:27.767 --> 00:03:29.567
where all my answers are lies.

00:03:29.567 --> 00:03:31.734
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:03:31.734 --> 00:03:32.801
-Hey, you've been flossing?

00:03:32.801 --> 00:03:35.334
-Floss?
Yeah, twice a day, I floss.

00:03:35.334 --> 00:03:36.534
-Four or five times a day.

00:03:36.534 --> 00:03:38.400
-Are you kidding me, man?
I can't stop flossing.

00:03:38.400 --> 00:03:39.934
Love that stuff.
-They call me Mr. Floss.

00:03:39.934 --> 00:03:41.501
-So fun to floss.
-I love it.

00:03:41.501 --> 00:03:42.868
-Are you kidding me?
-Six times a day --

00:03:42.868 --> 00:03:44.367
-They call me Mr. Floss at work.

00:03:44.367 --> 00:03:46.267
[ Laughter ]

00:03:46.267 --> 00:03:47.534
♪♪

00:03:47.534 --> 00:03:50.033
Thank you, soy sauce packets,

00:03:50.033 --> 00:03:52.100
for guaranteeing
I get three drops on my food

00:03:52.100 --> 00:03:54.000
and 500 drops on my shirt.

00:03:54.000 --> 00:03:56.100
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:04:04.300 --> 00:04:05.400
♪♪

00:04:05.400 --> 00:04:08.234
Thank you, zinc lozenges.

00:04:08.234 --> 00:04:09.634
You may not shorten my cold,

00:04:09.634 --> 00:04:10.834
but at least
you make my mouth feel

00:04:10.834 --> 00:04:13.267
like I sucked on a roll
of dirty nickles.

00:04:13.267 --> 00:04:15.434
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:04:17.567 --> 00:04:19.234
I think it's helping me?

00:04:21.701 --> 00:04:22.934
♪♪

00:04:22.934 --> 00:04:25.100
Thank you, salad spinners,

00:04:25.100 --> 00:04:27.167
for being a teacup ride
for lettuce.

00:04:27.167 --> 00:04:29.133
There you have it, everybody.
Those are our thank-you notes.

